# Cause-Site Only (ex Diff Only)

Use **only after** the user explicitly asks to implement (“수정해”, “OK”, “진행”).  
Diagnosis phase = **Bug Hunter** (no code). This rule = implementation scope.

## Do

- Change **only** the cause site identified in the approved proposal
- Same-assumption consumers may be updated in **one pass** if required to keep a single path (no parallel old/new)
- Match existing style

## Don't

- Don't edit outside the cause site “while here”
- Don't add recovery / workaround branches at symptom sites
- Don't replace whole files unless necessary
- Don't add unsolicited docs, TODOs spam, or extra systems
- Don't implement before user OK (use Bug Hunter first)
